Barracuda's auxiliary library touches no files, processes or C heap.

Removes luaL_fileresult, luaL_execresult and luaL_loadfilex (errno, process
status and stdio), and luaL_newstate with its realloc allocator, panic
printer and stderr warnings: every state is created with lua_newstate and an
allocator the embedder supplies.

